# Phase 2.5 – PII Containment & Protection

## Scope
Customer and employee contact PII including names, email addresses, phone numbers, and shipping addresses.

## Controls Implemented
- Identification of PII storage locations
- Definition of authoritative storage locations
- Access-based restrictions
- Reduction of local data duplication
- Device-level encryption for endpoints

## Rationale
Controls were selected to provide reasonable protection proportional to data sensitivity without disrupting business workflows.
